HHIISSTTOORRYY
     A ppaauussee() system call first appeared in the Programmer's Workbench
     (PWB/UNIX) and was then ported to Version 7 AT&T UNIX.  It was reim‐
     plemeted as a wrapper around the ssiiggppaauussee() and ssiiggbblloocckk() system calls
     in 4.2BSD, and around the sigsuspend(2) and sigprocmask(2) system calls
     in 4.3BSD-Reno.

